{"exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":false,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"x":100,"mirrow":false,"y":-304,"img":"chara051_1","addImg":"chara051_1_face_chara051_1b"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":false,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"timeBak":300,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":0,"scaleY":1,"nonStandBright":false,"x":100,"mirrow":false,"y":-304,"img":"chara051_1","addImg":"chara051_1_face_chara051_1b"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"阿莱克西娅","text":"[show]哇——好棒的营地！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"阿莱克西娅","text":"[show]功能这么齐全，而且看上去每一块材料都被使用的十分舒畅，没有一点冗余的地方。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara051_1_face_chara051_1c"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"阿莱克西娅","text":"[show]“舒畅”……啊、抱歉，不小心用了难懂的说法。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"阿莱克西娅","text":"[show]我们的传说中，是水神塞瓦大人用自己的生命力滋养了深渊中的一切，包括山、水、大气和生灵。[r][l]所以深渊之中的任何东西都像是塞瓦大人的孩子一般，当然也包括被作为建材的材料。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"阿莱克西娅","text":"[show]正如塞瓦大人奉献自身，祂的孩子们也拥有着这种奉献的品格，这种品格会跨越种族的区别，部分生灵会为我们所取食，而我们会耕作与栽培，便是如此。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"阿莱克西娅","text":"[show]所以我认为，应该让做出奉献的万物尽可能发挥其最大的功效。物尽其用，而不是铺张浪费，这也是对他们的奉献所表示的敬意。这样，会让付出奉献一侧的灵魂感到舒畅。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara051_1_face_chara051_1b"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"阿莱克西娅","text":"[show]我觉得，你的营地很好的体现了这种敬意。说得有些难懂，真不好意思。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara051_1_face_chara051_1c"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":100,"mirrow":false,"y":-304,"img":"chara051_1","addImg":"chara051_1_face_chara051_1c"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"阿莱克西娅","text":"[show]您不必如此客气，能被邀请来这样的营地做客，是我的荣幸才对。[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":100,"mirrow":false,"y":-304,"img":"chara051_1","addImg":"chara051_1_face_chara051_1c"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"阿莱克西娅-对我们的营地感觉如何？","script":"sj_051_01"}